v0.8.0
Gameplay
  - all powerups work now: invulnerability, berserk, partial invisibility,
    radiation suit, computer area map and light amp visor, on vanilla's timers
    (incl. screen tints for invulnerability/suit, and monsters shooting wide
    while you're invisible)
  - backpack works now, and was invisible before (doomednum 8 had no sprite)
  - fist and chainsaw finally do damage (2-20, x10 for the fist with berserk)
Engine
  - MASSIVE performance optimizations (NUTS.WAD from ~2 fps to ~38 fps !!!)
  - add support for A LOT more linedef/sector specials! 
    Vanilla compatiblity should be complete now.
  - add attack & pain animations
  - improved lightning, we're now much closer to vanilla
  - wall/floor "fading" effect now also applies to awake monsters (still needs some tweaking)
  - fixed useable linedefs could be triggered from both sides
  - fixed a monster teleporting through a walk trigger ended up facing the
    wrong way (its landing angle got converted from degrees a second time)
  - fixed picking wrong player1 spawn if multiple player1 spawns are present
UI / HUD
  - new HUD strip showing which powerups are running and for how much longer
  - more accurate FPS counter
  - DEVMODE: add simple profiler overlay


